stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft : Parent creates story
  draft --> generating : AI write requested (credit held)
  generating --> ready : AI result persisted (credit consumed)
  generating --> draft : AI failed / stale / enqueue failed (credit released)
  draft --> ready : All pages written (custom story)
  ready --> generating : Regenerate (not yet played)
  ready --> draft : Page text cleared
